## Hardware

### Main Controller

- STM32 NUCLEO-F303RE

### Sensors

- MPU-6500 IMU
- ACS712ELC-30A current sensor
- DHT11 temperature/humidity sensor

### Motor Control

- L298N dual H-bridge motor driver
- Small brushed DC hobby motor

### Communication

- UART for serial monitoring

### Power

- External motor power supply
- STM32 powered independently
- Common ground between controller and motor-driver system
